<title>USA: A.H. Belo Q1 shr $0.38 vs $0.33 after gain.</title>
<headline>A.H. Belo Q1 shr $0.38 vs $0.33 after gain.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		     1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.38		    $0.33</p>
<p> Net		 17,627		   12,724</p>
<p> Oper Revs	 232,702		  187,244</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  45,874		   38,876</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>Note: Results for 1997 include one month of operations of The Providence Journal Co, which the company acquired in February for about $1.8 billion in cash, stock, assumed debt and transaction costs.</p>
<p>The company said the 1996 Q1 earnings per share includes a $0.06 gain per share on the sale of Maxam Entertainment to CBS.</p>
